<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Lantern Shield -->
  <DD_Lantern_Shield_Active.label>提灯护盾</DD_Lantern_Shield_Active.label>
  <!-- EN: The lantern carried by Michelle can erect a faintly visible shield to block incoming projectiles and melee slashes from the front. Once the incense in the lantern burns out, the shield will disappear. -->
  <DD_Lantern_Shield_Active.description>米鼠儿随身携带的提灯可以支起一面若隐若现的护盾，以抵挡面向方向袭来的射弹和近战挥砍。一旦灯中熏香烧尽，护盾就会消失。</DD_Lantern_Shield_Active.description>
